  {
   "xml_index": 5,
   "xml_name": "L12_005_Binary Search",
   "display_name": "Binary Search",
   "questiontext_html": "<p>If the list is <b>sorted</b>, we can do much better. <b>Binary search</b> looks at the <b>middle</b> item first. If it is the value, done. If the middle item is smaller than the value, the value can only be in the <b>right half</b>; if bigger, only in the <b>left half</b>. Either way, <b>half of the list is thrown away</b> with one look. Repeat on the remaining half.</p>\n<p>Searching for <code>23</code> in a sorted list of 10 items (blue: the part still being searched):</p>\n<table style=\"border-collapse:separate;border-spacing:2px 0;margin:6px 0 4px\"><tr><td style=\"padding-right:10px;white-space:nowrap;font-family:monospace\">step 1:</td><td style=\"text-align:center;padding:5px 7px;white-space:nowrap;font-family:monospace;font-size:14px;background:rgb(31,95,153);color:#fff;border-radius:2px\">2</td><td style=\"text-align:center;padding:5px 7px;white-space:nowrap;font-family:monospace;font-size:14px;background:rgb(36,103,161);color:#fff;border-radius:2px\">5</td><td style=\"text-align:center;padding:5px 7px;white-space:nowrap;font-family:monospace;font-size:14px;background:rgb(41,110,169);color:#fff;border-radius:2px\">8</td><td style=\"text-align:center;padding:5px 7px;white-space:nowrap;font-family:monospace;font-size:14px;background:rgb(45,118,176);color:#fff;border-radius:2px\">12</td><td style=\"text-align:center;padding:5px 7px;white-space:nowrap;font-family:monospace;font-size:14px;background:rgb(50,125,184);color:#fff;border-radius:2px\">16</td><td style=\"text-align:center;padding:5px 7px;white-space:nowrap;font-family:monospace;font-size:14px;background:rgb(55,133,192);color:#fff;border-radius:2px\">23</td><td style=\"text-align:center;padding:5px 7px;white-space:nowrap;font-family:monospace;font-size:14px;background:rgb(60,140,200);color:#fff;border-radius:2px\">38</td><td style=\"text-align:center;padding:5px 7px;white-space:nowrap;font-family:monospace;font-size:14px;background:rgb(64,148,207);color:#fff;border-radius:2px\">56</td><td style=\"text-align:center;padding:5px 7px;white-space:nowrap;font-family:monospace;font-size:14px;background:rgb(69,155,215);color:#fff;border-radius:2px\">72</td><td style=\"text-align:center;padding:5px 7px;white-space:nowrap;font-family:monospace;font-size:14px;background:rgb(74,163,223);color:#fff;border-radius:2px\">91</td></tr><tr><td style=\"padding-right:10px\"></td><td style=\"text-align:center;padding:1px 6px;font-size:12px;color:#8a939c\">0</td><td style=\"text-align:center;padding:1px 6px;font-size:12px;color:#8a939c\">1</td><td style=\"text-align:center;padding:1px 6px;font-size:12px;color:#8a939c\">2</td><td style=\"text-align:center;padding:1px 6px;font-size:12px;color:#8a939c\">3</td><td style=\"text-align:center;padding:1px 6px;font-size:12px;color:#8a939c\">4</td><td style=\"text-align:center;padding:1px 6px;font-size:12px;color:#8a939c\">5</td><td style=\"text-align:center;padding:1px 6px;font-size:12px;color:#8a939c\">6</td><td style=\"text-align:center;padding:1px 6px;font-size:12px;color:#8a939c\">7</td><td style=\"text-align:center;padding:1px 6px;font-size:12px;color:#8a939c\">8</td><td style=\"text-align:center;padding:1px 6px;font-size:12px;color:#8a939c\">9</td></tr><tr><td style=\"padding-right:10px\"></td><td style=\"text-align:center;font-size:12px;color:#16202b;white-space:nowrap\">&uarr;<br>lo</td><td style=\"text-align:center;font-size:12px;color:#16202b;white-space:nowrap\"></td><td style=\"text-align:center;font-size:12px;color:#16202b;white-space:nowrap\"></td><td style=\"text-align:center;font-size:12px;color:#16202b;white-space:nowrap\"></td><td style=\"text-align:center;font-size:12px;color:#16202b;white-space:nowrap\">&uarr;<br>mid</td><td style=\"text-align:center;font-size:12px;color:#16202b;white-space:nowrap\"></td><td style=\"text-align:center;font-size:12px;color:#16202b;white-space:nowrap\"></td><td style=\"text-align:center;font-size:12px;color:#16202b;white-space:nowrap\"></td><td style=\"text-align:center;font-size:12px;color:#16202b;white-space:nowrap\"></td><td style=\"text-align:center;font-size:12px;color:#16202b;white-space:nowrap\">&uarr;<br>hi</td></tr></table><div style=\"font-size:13px;color:#8a939c;margin:0 0 10px\">look at L[4] = 16; 16 &lt; 23: search the right half</div><table style=\"border-collapse:separate;border-spacing:2px 0;margin:6px 0 4px\"><tr><td style=\"padding-right:10px;white-space:nowrap;font-family:monospace\">step 2:</td><td style=\"text-align:center;padding:5px 7px;white-space:nowrap;font-family:monospace;font-size:14px;background:#e2e6ea;color:#8a939c;border-radius:2px\">2</td><td style=\"text-align:center;padding:5px 7px;white-space:nowrap;font-family:monospace;font-size:14px;background:#e2e6ea;color:#8a939c;border-radius:2px\">5</td><td style=\"text-align:center;padding:5px 7px;white-space:nowrap;font-family:monospace;font-size:14px;background:#e2e6ea;color:#8a939c;border-radius:2px\">8</td><td style=\"text-align:center;padding:5px 7px;white-space:nowrap;font-family:monospace;font-size:14px;background:#e2e6ea;color:#8a939c;border-radius:2px\">12</td><td style=\"text-align:center;padding:5px 7px;white-space:nowrap;font-family:monospace;font-size:14px;background:#e2e6ea;color:#8a939c;border-radius:2px\">16</td><td style=\"text-align:center;padding:5px 7px;white-space:nowrap;font-family:monospace;font-size:14px;background:rgb(55,133,192);color:#fff;border-radius:2px\">23</td><td style=\"text-align:center;padding:5px 7px;white-space:nowrap;font-family:monospace;font-size:14px;background:rgb(60,140,200);color:#fff;border-radius:2px\">38</td><td style=\"text-align:center;padding:5px 7px;white-space:nowrap;font-family:monospace;font-size:14px;background:rgb(64,148,207);color:#fff;border-radius:2px\">56</td><td style=\"text-align:center;padding:5px 7px;white-space:nowrap;font-family:monospace;font-size:14px;background:rgb(69,155,215);color:#fff;border-radius:2px\">72</td><td style=\"text-align:center;padding:5px 7px;white-space:nowrap;font-family:monospace;font-size:14px;background:rgb(74,163,223);color:#fff;border-radius:2px\">91</td></tr><tr><td style=\"padding-right:10px\"></td><td style=\"text-align:center;padding:1px 6px;font-size:12px;color:#8a939c\">0</td><td style=\"text-align:center;padding:1px 6px;font-size:12px;color:#8a939c\">1</td><td style=\"text-align:center;padding:1px 6px;font-size:12px;color:#8a939c\">2</td><td style=\"text-align:center;padding:1px 6px;font-size:12px;color:#8a939c\">3</td><td style=\"text-align:center;padding:1px 6px;font-size:12px;color:#8a939c\">4</td><td style=\"text-align:center;padding:1px 6px;font-size:12px;color:#8a939c\">5</td><td style=\"text-align:center;padding:1px 6px;font-size:12px;color:#8a939c\">6</td><td style=\"text-align:center;padding:1px 6px;font-size:12px;color:#8a939c\">7</td><td style=\"text-align:center;padding:1px 6px;font-size:12px;color:#8a939c\">8</td><td style=\"text-align:center;padding:1px 6px;font-size:12px;color:#8a939c\">9</td></tr><tr><td style=\"padding-right:10px\"></td><td style=\"text-align:center;font-size:12px;color:#16202b;white-space:nowrap\"></td><td style=\"text-align:center;font-size:12px;color:#16202b;white-space:nowrap\"></td><td style=\"text-align:center;font-size:12px;color:#16202b;white-space:nowrap\"></td><td style=\"text-align:center;font-size:12px;color:#16202b;white-space:nowrap\"></td><td style=\"text-align:center;font-size:12px;color:#16202b;white-space:nowrap\"></td><td style=\"text-align:center;font-size:12px;color:#16202b;white-space:nowrap\">&uarr;<br>lo</td><td style=\"text-align:center;font-size:12px;color:#16202b;white-space:nowrap\"></td><td style=\"text-align:center;font-size:12px;color:#16202b;white-space:nowrap\">&uarr;<br>mid</td><td style=\"text-align:center;font-size:12px;color:#16202b;white-space:nowrap\"></td><td style=\"text-align:center;font-size:12px;color:#16202b;white-space:nowrap\">&uarr;<br>hi</td></tr></table><div style=\"font-size:13px;color:#8a939c;margin:0 0 10px\">look at L[7] = 56; 56 &gt; 23: search the left half</div><table style=\"border-collapse:separate;border-spacing:2px 0;margin:6px 0 4px\"><tr><td style=\"padding-right:10px;white-space:nowrap;font-family:monospace\">step 3:</td><td style=\"text-align:center;padding:5px 7px;white-space:nowrap;font-family:monospace;font-size:14px;background:#e2e6ea;color:#8a939c;border-radius:2px\">2</td><td style=\"text-align:center;padding:5px 7px;white-space:nowrap;font-family:monospace;font-size:14px;background:#e2e6ea;color:#8a939c;border-radius:2px\">5</td><td style=\"text-align:center;padding:5px 7px;white-space:nowrap;font-family:monospace;font-size:14px;background:#e2e6ea;color:#8a939c;border-radius:2px\">8</td><td style=\"text-align:center;padding:5px 7px;white-space:nowrap;font-family:monospace;font-size:14px;background:#e2e6ea;color:#8a939c;border-radius:2px\">12</td><td style=\"text-align:center;padding:5px 7px;white-space:nowrap;font-family:monospace;font-size:14px;background:#e2e6ea;color:#8a939c;border-radius:2px\">16</td><td style=\"text-align:center;padding:5px 7px;white-space:nowrap;font-family:monospace;font-size:14px;background:rgb(55,133,192);color:#fff;border-radius:2px\">23</td><td style=\"text-align:center;padding:5px 7px;white-space:nowrap;font-family:monospace;font-size:14px;background:rgb(60,140,200);color:#fff;border-radius:2px\">38</td><td style=\"text-align:center;padding:5px 7px;white-space:nowrap;font-family:monospace;font-size:14px;background:#e2e6ea;color:#8a939c;border-radius:2px\">56</td><td style=\"text-align:center;padding:5px 7px;white-space:nowrap;font-family:monospace;font-size:14px;background:#e2e6ea;color:#8a939c;border-radius:2px\">72</td><td style=\"text-align:center;padding:5px 7px;white-space:nowrap;font-family:monospace;font-size:14px;background:#e2e6ea;color:#8a939c;border-radius:2px\">91</td></tr><tr><td style=\"padding-right:10px\"></td><td style=\"text-align:center;padding:1px 6px;font-size:12px;color:#8a939c\">0</td><td style=\"text-align:center;padding:1px 6px;font-size:12px;color:#8a939c\">1</td><td style=\"text-align:center;padding:1px 6px;font-size:12px;color:#8a939c\">2</td><td style=\"text-align:center;padding:1px 6px;font-size:12px;color:#8a939c\">3</td><td style=\"text-align:center;padding:1px 6px;font-size:12px;color:#8a939c\">4</td><td style=\"text-align:center;padding:1px 6px;font-size:12px;color:#8a939c\">5</td><td style=\"text-align:center;padding:1px 6px;font-size:12px;color:#8a939c\">6</td><td style=\"text-align:center;padding:1px 6px;font-size:12px;color:#8a939c\">7</td><td style=\"text-align:center;padding:1px 6px;font-size:12px;color:#8a939c\">8</td><td style=\"text-align:center;padding:1px 6px;font-size:12px;color:#8a939c\">9</td></tr><tr><td style=\"padding-right:10px\"></td><td style=\"text-align:center;font-size:12px;color:#16202b;white-space:nowrap\"></td><td style=\"text-align:center;font-size:12px;color:#16202b;white-space:nowrap\"></td><td style=\"text-align:center;font-size:12px;color:#16202b;white-space:nowrap\"></td><td style=\"text-align:center;font-size:12px;color:#16202b;white-space:nowrap\"></td><td style=\"text-align:center;font-size:12px;color:#16202b;white-space:nowrap\"></td><td style=\"text-align:center;font-size:12px;color:#16202b;white-space:nowrap\">&uarr;<br>lo mid</td><td style=\"text-align:center;font-size:12px;color:#16202b;white-space:nowrap\">&uarr;<br>hi</td><td style=\"text-align:center;font-size:12px;color:#16202b;white-space:nowrap\"></td><td style=\"text-align:center;font-size:12px;color:#16202b;white-space:nowrap\"></td><td style=\"text-align:center;font-size:12px;color:#16202b;white-space:nowrap\"></td></tr></table><div style=\"font-size:13px;color:#8a939c;margin:0 0 10px\">look at L[5] = 23; found!</div>\n<p>Only 3 looks instead of 6. Each step halves the remaining part, so binary search needs at most about <code>log n</code> looks: it is <b>O(log n)</b>. For a million items: about 20 looks instead of a million!</p>\n<pre>binary_search(L, x):\n    lo = 0\n    hi = len(L) - 1\n    while lo &lt;= hi:\n        mid = (lo + hi) // 2\n        v = probe(L, mid)          # look ONCE per step, and keep the value in v\n        if v == x:\n            return mid\n        else if v &lt; x:\n            lo = mid + 1           # continue in the right half\n        else:\n            hi = mid - 1           # continue in the left half\n    return -1</pre>\n<p>Note: call <code>probe</code> <b>exactly once per step</b> and store the value, as in the pseudocode; calling it again for each comparison would count extra looks.</p>\n<p><b>Indentation reminder:</b> the body of an <code>if</code>, loop, function or class must be indented (press Tab or type 4 spaces). Only the spaces at the start of a line matter.</p>\n<p><b>Your task:</b> write the function <code>binary_search(L, x)</code> following the pseudocode exactly. <code>L</code> is sorted from small to large. Return the index of <code>x</code>, or <code>-1</code> if it is not in <code>L</code>.</p>\n<p>For example, <code>binary_search([2, 5, 8, 12, 16, 23, 38, 56, 72, 91], 23)</code> returns <code>5</code> after 3 looks.</p>",
   "answerpreload": "# ---- Helper functions: do not change them; the tests count how often you call them ----\ndef probe(L, i):\n    # Look at the item at index i. Use this EVERY time you read an item.\n    return L[i]\n\n\ndef binary_search(L, x):\n    # write your code here\n\n\n# ---- Use this space to test your code; comment it out before Check ----\n# print(binary_search([2, 5, 8, 12, 16, 23, 38, 56, 72, 91], 23))\n",
   "mark": 1.0,
   "tests": [
    {
     "testcode": "_c = {\"probe\": 0}\n_probe = probe\ndef probe(*args):\n    _c[\"probe\"] += 1\n    return _probe(*args)\nprint(binary_search([2, 5, 8, 12, 16, 23, 38, 56, 72, 91], 23), 'looks:', _c['probe'])",
     "stdin": "",
     "expected": "5 looks: 3",
     "extra": "",
     "show": true,
     "example": true,
     "in_precheck": true,
     "in_check": true
    },
    {
     "testcode": "_c = {\"probe\": 0}\n_probe = probe\ndef probe(*args):\n    _c[\"probe\"] += 1\n    return _probe(*args)\nprint(binary_search([2, 5, 8, 12, 16, 23, 38, 56, 72, 91], 3), 'looks:', _c['probe'])",
     "stdin": "",
     "expected": "-1 looks: 3",
     "extra": "",
     "show": true,
     "example": true,
     "in_precheck": false,
     "in_check": true
    },
    {
     "testcode": "_c = {\"probe\": 0}\n_probe = probe\ndef probe(*args):\n    _c[\"probe\"] += 1\n    return _probe(*args)\nprint(binary_search([], 3), binary_search([3], 3), 'looks:', _c['probe'])",
     "stdin": "",
     "expected": "-1 0 looks: 1",
     "extra": "",
