  {
   "xml_index": 10,
   "xml_name": "L12_010_Selection Sort",
   "display_name": "Selection Sort",
   "questiontext_html": "<p><b>Selection sort</b> repeatedly <b>selects</b> the smallest remaining item and swaps it into the next place at the front:</p>\n<table style=\"border-collapse:separate;border-spacing:2px 0;margin:6px 0 4px\"><tr><td style=\"padding-right:10px;white-space:nowrap;font-family:monospace\">start:</td><td style=\"text-align:center;padding:5px 7px;white-space:nowrap;font-family:monospace;font-size:14px;background:rgb(31,95,153);color:#fff;border-radius:2px\">5</td><td style=\"text-align:center;padding:5px 7px;white-space:nowrap;font-family:monospace;font-size:14px;background:rgb(42,112,170);color:#fff;border-radius:2px\">1</td><td style=\"text-align:center;padding:5px 7px;white-space:nowrap;font-family:monospace;font-size:14px;background:rgb(52,129,188);color:#fff;border-radius:2px\">4</td><td style=\"text-align:center;padding:5px 7px;white-space:nowrap;font-family:monospace;font-size:14px;background:rgb(63,146,206);color:#fff;border-radius:2px\">2</td><td style=\"text-align:center;padding:5px 7px;white-space:nowrap;font-family:monospace;font-size:14px;background:rgb(74,163,223);color:#fff;border-radius:2px\">8</td></tr></table><table style=\"border-collapse:separate;border-spacing:2px 0;margin:6px 0 4px\"><tr><td style=\"padding-right:10px;white-space:nowrap;font-family:monospace\">i = 0:</td><td style=\"text-align:center;padding:5px 7px;white-space:nowrap;font-family:monospace;font-size:14px;background:rgb(31,95,153);color:#fff;border-radius:2px\">1</td><td style=\"text-align:center;padding:5px 7px;white-space:nowrap;font-family:monospace;font-size:14px;background:#e2e6ea;color:#8a939c;border-radius:2px\">5</td><td style=\"text-align:center;padding:5px 7px;white-space:nowrap;font-family:monospace;font-size:14px;background:#e2e6ea;color:#8a939c;border-radius:2px\">4</td><td style=\"text-align:center;padding:5px 7px;white-space:nowrap;font-family:monospace;font-size:14px;background:#e2e6ea;color:#8a939c;border-radius:2px\">2</td><td style=\"text-align:center;padding:5px 7px;white-space:nowrap;font-family:monospace;font-size:14px;background:#e2e6ea;color:#8a939c;border-radius:2px\">8</td></tr></table><table style=\"border-collapse:separate;border-spacing:2px 0;margin:6px 0 4px\"><tr><td style=\"padding-right:10px;white-space:nowrap;font-family:monospace\">i = 1:</td><td style=\"text-align:center;padding:5px 7px;white-space:nowrap;font-family:monospace;font-size:14px;background:rgb(31,95,153);color:#fff;border-radius:2px\">1</td><td style=\"text-align:center;padding:5px 7px;white-space:nowrap;font-family:monospace;font-size:14px;background:rgb(42,112,170);color:#fff;border-radius:2px\">2</td><td style=\"text-align:center;padding:5px 7px;white-space:nowrap;font-family:monospace;font-size:14px;background:#e2e6ea;color:#8a939c;border-radius:2px\">4</td><td style=\"text-align:center;padding:5px 7px;white-space:nowrap;font-family:monospace;font-size:14px;background:#e2e6ea;color:#8a939c;border-radius:2px\">5</td><td style=\"text-align:center;padding:5px 7px;white-space:nowrap;font-family:monospace;font-size:14px;background:#e2e6ea;color:#8a939c;border-radius:2px\">8</td></tr></table><table style=\"border-collapse:separate;border-spacing:2px 0;margin:6px 0 4px\"><tr><td style=\"padding-right:10px;white-space:nowrap;font-family:monospace\">i = 2:</td><td style=\"text-align:center;padding:5px 7px;white-space:nowrap;font-family:monospace;font-size:14px;background:rgb(31,95,153);color:#fff;border-radius:2px\">1</td><td style=\"text-align:center;padding:5px 7px;white-space:nowrap;font-family:monospace;font-size:14px;background:rgb(42,112,170);color:#fff;border-radius:2px\">2</td><td style=\"text-align:center;padding:5px 7px;white-space:nowrap;font-family:monospace;font-size:14px;background:rgb(52,129,188);color:#fff;border-radius:2px\">4</td><td style=\"text-align:center;padding:5px 7px;white-space:nowrap;font-family:monospace;font-size:14px;background:#e2e6ea;color:#8a939c;border-radius:2px\">5</td><td style=\"text-align:center;padding:5px 7px;white-space:nowrap;font-family:monospace;font-size:14px;background:#e2e6ea;color:#8a939c;border-radius:2px\">8</td></tr></table><table style=\"border-collapse:separate;border-spacing:2px 0;margin:6px 0 4px\"><tr><td style=\"padding-right:10px;white-space:nowrap;font-family:monospace\">i = 3:</td><td style=\"text-align:center;padding:5px 7px;white-space:nowrap;font-family:monospace;font-size:14px;background:rgb(31,95,153);color:#fff;border-radius:2px\">1</td><td style=\"text-align:center;padding:5px 7px;white-space:nowrap;font-family:monospace;font-size:14px;background:rgb(42,112,170);color:#fff;border-radius:2px\">2</td><td style=\"text-align:center;padding:5px 7px;white-space:nowrap;font-family:monospace;font-size:14px;background:rgb(52,129,188);color:#fff;border-radius:2px\">4</td><td style=\"text-align:center;padding:5px 7px;white-space:nowrap;font-family:monospace;font-size:14px;background:rgb(63,146,206);color:#fff;border-radius:2px\">5</td><td style=\"text-align:center;padding:5px 7px;white-space:nowrap;font-family:monospace;font-size:14px;background:#e2e6ea;color:#8a939c;border-radius:2px\">8</td></tr></table><div style=\"font-size:13px;color:#8a939c;margin:0 0 10px\">blue: the smallest items, chosen one at a time and put in their final place</div>\n<pre>selection_sort(L):\n    n = len(L)\n    for i = 0, 1, ..., n - 2:\n        m = i                              # index of the smallest so far\n        for j = i + 1, ..., n - 1:\n            if less(L, j, m):\n                m = j\n        if m != i:\n            swap(L, i, m)</pre>\n<p>It always makes <code>n * (n - 1) / 2</code> comparisons (<b>O(n²)</b>), but at most <code>n - 1</code> swaps: useful when swapping is expensive.</p>\n<p><b>Indentation reminder:</b> the body of an <code>if</code>, loop, function or class must be indented (press Tab or type 4 spaces). Only the spaces at the start of a line matter.</p>\n<p><b>Your task:</b> write the function <code>selection_sort(L)</code> following the pseudocode exactly, using the helpers <code>less(L, i, j)</code> (is <code>L[i] &lt; L[j]</code>?) and <code>swap</code>.</p>\n<p>For example, sorting <code>[5, 1, 4, 2, 8]</code> takes 10 comparisons and 2 swaps.</p>",
   "answerpreload": "# ---- Helper functions: do not change them; the tests count how often you call them ----\ndef less(L, i, j):\n    # True if the item at index i is smaller than the item at index j.\n    return L[i] < L[j]\n\n\ndef swap(L, i, j):\n    # Exchange the items at indexes i and j.\n    L[i], L[j] = L[j], L[i]\n\n\ndef selection_sort(L):\n    # write your code here\n\n\n# ---- Use this space to test your code; comment it out before Check ----\n# L = [5, 1, 4, 2, 8]\n# selection_sort(L)\n# print(L)\n",
   "mark": 1.0,
   "tests": [
    {
     "testcode": "_c = {\"less\": 0, \"swap\": 0}\n_less = less\ndef less(*args):\n    _c[\"less\"] += 1\n    return _less(*args)\n_swap = swap\ndef swap(*args):\n    _c[\"swap\"] += 1\n    return _swap(*args)\nL = [5, 1, 4, 2, 8]\nselection_sort(L)\nprint(L, 'comparisons:', _c['less'], 'swaps:', _c['swap'])",
     "stdin": "",
     "expected": "[1, 2, 4, 5, 8] comparisons: 10 swaps: 2",
     "extra": "",
     "show": true,
     "example": true,
     "in_precheck": true,
     "in_check": true
    },
    {
